  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tsrdJZM.jpg\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>英文版</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Voyager光影2.0是對第一代Voyager的改進版本，修正了初代的不足之處並新增了多種視覺效果！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Optifine兼容性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本光影僅支援1.16.5/1.7.1/1.18.2/1.19.2/1.9.3版本的Optifine，舊版可能無法正常運作</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Optifine下載：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://optifine.net/downloads</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Iris兼容性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需Iris 1.4及以上版本方可載入本光影，舊版將完全無法讀取</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Iris下載：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firisshaders.net%252fdownload.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://irisshaders.net/download.html</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>錯誤回報</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若發現Voyager 2.0相關錯誤，請至Discord頻道#bugs回報（請先閱讀置頂公告）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Discord連結：discord.gg/2eyNefx</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支援模組</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Voyager 2.0相容以下模組：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-更多生物群系&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-植物魔法</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-異常氣候</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-異常秋色</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-異常生態</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-異常甜點</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-異常水域更新</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-異常忙碌蜜蜂</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-地球生物模組</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-荒蕪之地</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-星輝魔法</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-農夫樂事</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-你將前往的生物群系</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-生態過渡帶</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-大地物語</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-野生世界</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-動態樹木</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>使用條款</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-用於遊戲截圖/影片製作</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-用於整合包</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-個人用途的修改</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-建立轉載連結（僅限官方Curseforge頁面/SixSeven67的PlanetMinecraft頁面/6ix7even的Modrinth頁面）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您不可：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-二次分發本光影（僅Symbiome67的Curseforge頁面與SixSeven67的PlanetMinecraft頁面為官方管道）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-分發修改版本</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-使用營利性短網址轉載</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>法文版</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Optifine相容性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（此處保留法文原文）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（法文版內容維持不變）</span></p>",
